<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Assets Surge as Lula Taps Trabuco as Finance Minister&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</link><description>德意志交易所股份公司 (Deutsche Boerse AG) 以 53 亿欧元（58 亿美元）收购 Allfunds Group Plc 的交易已获得欧盟无条件批准，为这家德国交易所运营商历史上最大的收购铺平了道路。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval'&gt;德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Deutsche Boerse’s €5.3 billion Allfunds Bid Gets EU Approval&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧洲风力过多，电网不足</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/europe-has-too-much-wind-not-enough-power-grid</link><description>非洲大陆增加可再生电力的速度快于输送电力所需的基础设施建设速度，导致消费者为此付出代价。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/europe-has-too-much-wind-not-enough-power-grid'&gt;欧洲风力过多，电网不足&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe Has Too Much Wind, Not Enough Power Grid&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/europe-has-too-much-wind-not-enough-power-grid</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:33:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>西班牙的Volverá la derecha al poder？</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/-volvera-la-derecha-al-poder-en-espana</link><description>西班牙即将迎来巨大的紧张局势。 Las encuestas apuntan a un regreso de la derecha, pero en 2023 también lo hicieron y Pedro Sánchez logró mantenerse en el poder. ¿Qué está en juego esta vez？ （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/-volvera-la-derecha-al-poder-en-espana'&gt;西班牙的Volverá la derecha al poder？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：¿Volverá la derecha al poder en España?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/-volvera-la-derecha-al-poder-en-espana</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:41:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Ofwat 警告泰晤士河水上救援决定仍需数月时间</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/ofwat-warns-thames-water-rescue-decision-remains-months-away</link><description>英国水务监管机构警告称，距离决定是否批准债权人救助泰晤士水务公司还需要几个月的时间。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/ofwat-warns-thames-water-rescue-decision-remains-months-away'&gt;Ofwat 警告泰晤士河水上救援决定仍需数月时间&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ofwat Warns Thames Water Rescue Decision Remains Months Away&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/ofwat-warns-thames-water-rescue-decision-remains-months-away</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:47:58 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>